{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b7f945ccebd1d019c989a2e1c70fd3e8317056631950cf1184ce7212e7f482b5", "ja": "（ひなたを探していると、更衣室にいた。\n熱心に鏡をのぞき込んでいるみたいだけど……）", "zh": "（我找着日向时，发现她在更衣室里。\n她好像正专心地盯着镜子看……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "e78fd66126c96e1c219fd7eecf7db375a90d10e899bdaa2f0ca49be408258721", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。お疲れさんです。\nありゃあ、見られちゃったべさ……えへへ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。辛苦了。\n哎呀，被看到了呀……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1002_p", "source_sha256": "87e35c0e504653fa97b8ca3b6bbbc5a2937966782902f60142e662475a59e5fb", "ja": "お疲れさま、ひなた。\nそんなに鏡をのぞき込んで、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，日向。你一直凑在镜子前看，是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "2d66225afd956f1679ebc8e758e6e3326b8b41e7dad38ebc2522baff14988831", "ja": "うん。えっと……ちょっこし恥ずかしいから、\nみんなにはナイショにしてねえ。", "zh": "嗯。那个……因为有点害羞，所以要替我对大家保密哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "dd1d7a09de24195f031d90f5dd4893c5ad829ed4a9ba1ec0bc3574333f07fb34", "ja": "実はあたし、怖い顔の練習をしてたんだよぉ。", "zh": "其实我刚才，是在练习做吓人的表情呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1005_p", "source_sha256": "531c6e88af5d57869dc7d1fb03bdf91ab1da59a2f39015abf86f6d4aea02640c", "ja": "怖い顔の練習？", "zh": "练习凶狠的表情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "1cf38504f35e4bf6e4d17fab9c024cddb742eedeae9203a228354dae0894aad0", "ja": "うん。今度、劇場で『果てしなく仁義ない戦い』の\n試写会とお渡し会をするって聞いたからねぇ。", "zh": "嗯。听说下次剧场要举办《无尽的无仁义之战》的试映会和赠礼会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "6d0e7f29183e9f41d396b83a2ce79e315ff58b6538c167bcb3622c2f13b471bd", "ja": "挨拶の時くらい、組長さんらしく\n怖い顔になれんかなぁと思ったんだけども……。", "zh": "我本来想，至少在打招呼的时候，能不能摆出一副像组长的可怕表情……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1008_p", "source_sha256": "cedf4ffb0c1734a73fd93eb65329689e0ca6918d7d698b937286ee2ab183e301", "ja": "そうか。あまり怖くはなかったけど……。", "zh": "这样啊。虽然没怎么吓人就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "3e0aadba628d10b9ceac48a61beadb4e242a038e0c4db3b7a313251e1a8d2f14", "ja": "はぁ……そうだよねぇ。さっきから練習してるのに、\nなんだか、ちっとも怖くならないんだわ。", "zh": "唉……是啊。明明从刚才开始一直在练习，\n可总觉得，怎么都害怕不起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "d7e3783628ac3f34f036c5ae5305ed21f6e84b78aca7dd980e2c2db8fa133c89", "ja": "映画の中では、ちゃんとできたと思ったんだけども。\nやっぱり、お芝居は難しいべさ。", "zh": "在电影里，我以为自己做到了呢。\n果然，演戏还是很难啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "b95863588342a2e030aefefd4414fb127d2a68ae4287954086c9d2a4c6dd0cfe", "ja": "桃子センパイに相談したら、「怖いセリフを言って\nみたら？」ってアドバイスをくれたんだけども……。", "zh": "我去找桃子前辈商量，她建议我“要不要试着说些吓人的台词？”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d697de8c693a87be1ca07ef8d94bf83ebf23f54dd26409115c3556f8f997eb5c", "ja": "なるほど。確かに、怒ったりしている時のほうが\n怖い顔になるかもしれないな。", "zh": "原来如此。确实，生气的时候，表情可能会更吓人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "d167c0852594393bf10721d5984f675e918816b2ec5403d92150a1403e52af1c", "ja": "けど、怒るったって、誰に怒るんだい？", "zh": "不过，就算要生气，又要对谁生气呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d6ba3a0e0a4a11cf04a89fcdab1fc229d5614208d61a2ae36f12b68eb8835a68", "ja": "そうだな。じゃあ試しに、俺に怒ってみたらどうだ？\n魅梨音組の幹部……木下組の敵対勢力だと思って。", "zh": "是啊。那么不妨试着对我发火看看？  \n就把我当成魅梨音组的干部……木下组的敌对势力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "2cd14bdbc6980405caa495de4bbddc2b4a6bafcc21c3443118b61543a5411f1e", "ja": "{$P$}を……わかったべさ。\n……あ、あー。", "zh": "对着{$P$}发火啊……俺知道了。\n……啊、啊——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "fcababe23b971b35791a349b273ede7b3297ed2ff43f3a9f174fb4ae17ecf96a", "ja": "あんたが、魅梨音組の{$P$}？\nへぇ……そうかい。", "zh": "你就是魅梨音组的{$P$}？\n哦……这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "e93a14752d1e1c8888eb85cfc1f14e411a02606b8b9c9a84fb755a35cf86c4c6", "ja": "このあたしに楯突くとは、\nあんた、いい度胸してるねぇ……。", "zh": "居然敢跟我作对，\n你胆子不小啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "ee1cc5951c9996ee476ddd182c9ca69cdefe4042aafcc69aed3f01111ab7af18", "ja": "えっと……\nこんな感じで、どうだろか？", "zh": "那个……\n像这样，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3076b4767cb5e4bca7fb5090f92e3ce98ac0110934e915ffd8dfd09a0f393b98", "ja": "おお……今のは良かったんじゃないか？　ひなた。\nひなた組長っぽかったと思うよ。", "zh": "哦……刚才那段不是挺好的吗，日向。\n我觉得很有日向组长的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "4ea42be9306bc55236dbe2ff5dd6e7786a514ea5620176d79fc14c693961410f", "ja": "本当かい？　練習したかいがあったよぉ。\nありがとね、{$P$}。", "zh": "真的吗？看来练习没有白费呢。\n谢谢你，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0153_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "f92f54a8033f9528348254b7af5341438c093bb496e719eff2751775b0e97583", "ja": "けど、困ったねぇ。挨拶の時は、\n誰に怒ればいいんだろか……？　う～ん……。", "zh": "不过，这可难办了。打招呼的时候，该对谁发火才好呢……？嗯……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
